    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26160" root="ضون" body-key="D">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَوْنَةٌ</span></b> , (K,) an inf. n. of which the verb is
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَانَ</span>, aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَضُونُ</span>, said of a man, (TK,) The
<i>having numerous offspring;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَضَوُّنٌ</span></b> .
(K.) [Probably from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَيْوَنٌ</span>.]

